7. FINDINGS
   DR-03   DESIGN DEFECT (known), OPEN: DRAWN A U18; record l4e4: R138 10 mOhm trips under the 3 A contracts; its draft apply_gen_sch_a_r138.py (5 mOhm, L4-E9 R-05) corrects it, DRAFTED
   EF-F03  DESIGN DEFECT, OPEN: DRAWN A U23; V6-m6: R98 453 R, the recommended minimum itself, its corners at 445.8 Ohm outside the range and the band's top over the 2 A rating (round 1's EF-O03, read EDGE); corrected by apply_gen_sch_a_u23ilm.py (511 R), DRAFTED
   EF-F01  DESIGN DEFECT, OPEN: DRAWN B U23; SDR3-F04 confirmed: R36 301 R, '3.0 A', outside TPS2596's range; corrected by apply_gen_sch_b_u23ilm.py (750 R), DRAFTED
   EF-F02  DESIGN DEFECT, OPEN: DRAWN B U24; R43 301 R, '3.0 A', the same setting on the RockBLOCK's eFuse; corrected by apply_gen_sch_b_u24ilm.py (1.21 k), DRAFTED
